# A face referencing a vertex index (999) far beyond the 3 positions
# actually defined below - DecodeMeshOBJ's own defensive bounds check
# must reject this (tinyobjloader's own index-fixing does not validate
# an index against the parsed vertex count itself - only relative
# (negative) indices are range-checked).

v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0

f 1 2 999
